      "role": "user",
      "content": "The weird thing is, the maintenance logs show the unit was serviced just last week and everything was perfect. There's no mechanical reason for the compressor to just quit like that. It felt almost like it was sabotaged or something. Is there anything else I should look for in the unit to see if something was intentionally messed with?",
